WEBVTT

00:01.590 --> 00:05.190
I can clearly see the reason 
you have let your guard down.

00:07.800 --> 00:11.850
You must score in the school's 
top ten on your next test.

00:11.850 --> 00:16.580
If you are unable to do that, I will 
send you straight back to Tokyo!

00:35.180 --> 00:37.850
<b>Hokkaido Gals Are Super Adorable!</b>

00:38.690 --> 00:42.060
<b>Hokkaido Gals Are Super Adorable!</b>

01:50.220 --> 01:52.970
Super Cute Angels ♥

01:50.220 --> 01:52.970
<b>Hokkaido Gals Are</b>

01:50.220 --> 01:52.970
<b>Boom!</b>

01:50.220 --> 01:52.970
<b>Super Adorable</b>

01:53.630 --> 01:58.300
<b>Episode 7:
Final Exams Are Super Hard</b>

01:53.630 --> 01:58.300
<b>Episode 7:
Final Exams Are Super Hard</b>

01:53.870 --> 01:54.960
See you later.

02:03.330 --> 02:08.110
<i>I never imagined that the first exams 
in my new situation would be like this.</i>

02:09.050 --> 02:12.240
<i>But it's true that I have been distracted.</i>

02:13.360 --> 02:15.840
<i>I guess it was going to 
happen sooner or later.</i>

02:16.290 --> 02:20.290
<i>Now that it has, I'm really going to have 
to put my heart and soul into studying!</i>

02:20.970 --> 02:22.050
Shiki-kun!

02:22.770 --> 02:25.640
Good morning.

02:25.640 --> 02:26.970
Senpai!

02:27.950 --> 02:30.070
I've been waiting for you.

02:30.070 --> 02:31.500
Huh? Why?

02:31.500 --> 02:34.370
There are some things I 
wanted to talk to you about.

02:34.810 --> 02:35.730
Is that all right?

02:35.730 --> 02:38.260
Uh, well...

02:38.260 --> 02:42.480
<i>I'd like to, but I'm not sure I'd 
be much fun to talk to right now.</i>

02:42.480 --> 02:44.180
You seem somewhat gloomy.

02:44.180 --> 02:44.890
Huh?

02:45.100 --> 02:49.980
Did you get in trouble because I 
leaned up against you yesterday?

02:49.980 --> 02:51.940
No, no, that's not it. It's just...

02:52.660 --> 02:56.200
I'm kind of struggling with my studies.

02:56.900 --> 03:01.400
I'm really sorry about that, though. 
I just love all things historical,

03:01.400 --> 03:05.350
and when I see Japanese clothes in 
particular, I simply take leave of my senses.

03:05.350 --> 03:07.180
Oh, I see.

03:07.710 --> 03:12.330
<i>What an unusual fetish! But I didn't 
realize she was a history buff.</i>

03:12.650 --> 03:15.550
<i>That explains a lot of 
what happened yesterday.</i>

03:17.430 --> 03:20.090
By way of an apology,

03:20.580 --> 03:23.040
would you like me to tutor you?

03:23.470 --> 03:26.730
You are worried about your studies, correct?

03:26.730 --> 03:29.360
Yeah, but well, it isn't 
just the studying itself.

03:29.770 --> 03:32.550
How do I put this...
It's more about the ranking.

03:32.550 --> 03:33.610
Wow!

03:33.920 --> 03:36.300
So you're worried that my rank is too low

03:36.300 --> 03:39.770
and there would be no 
point in learning from me?

03:39.770 --> 03:42.120
N-No! That's not what I meant!

03:42.120 --> 03:47.720
I don't have any problem with you at all! 
I'm just aiming for a pretty high rank.

03:48.370 --> 03:50.710
Then you have nothing to worry about.

03:51.500 --> 03:56.060
Since the day I enrolled, 
I've always been number one in school.

03:56.590 --> 03:58.640
Always number one?!

03:58.640 --> 04:03.360
I could even teach you past trends and 
strategies for the different subject tests.

04:03.760 --> 04:07.520
<i>Not just her looks, 
but she has top-level brains, too!</i>

04:08.340 --> 04:12.360
<i>Did she actually figure out that 
problem instantly yesterday?</i>

04:13.630 --> 04:15.840
<i>If I can get her to tutor me,</i>

04:16.990 --> 04:19.270
<i>top ten would be within my reach!</i>

04:20.050 --> 04:22.930
Senpai, please do teach me!

04:24.010 --> 04:26.870
<i>I have to make top ten, no matter what.</i>

04:27.280 --> 04:29.940
<i>I want to keep living here in Hokkaido!</i>

04:33.310 --> 04:36.750
Very well. You have impressed 
me with your determination.

04:37.100 --> 04:39.470
I will do all I can to teach you.

04:40.330 --> 04:41.970
Thank you very much!

04:42.960 --> 04:45.890
For the next three days, 
we only have morning classes,

04:45.890 --> 04:49.480
so please come to the library 
storage room after class each day.

04:49.480 --> 04:51.850
Library... storage room?

04:52.170 --> 04:56.000
Before tests, the library is 
left open for independent study,

04:56.000 --> 04:59.870
but I will let you in to a storage 
room that nobody else has access to.

04:59.870 --> 05:03.240
Uh, but is it okay to do that?

05:03.240 --> 05:06.740
Certainly! I am on the library 
committee, after all.

05:08.360 --> 05:10.620
<i>What an abuse of authority!</i>

05:12.250 --> 05:13.500
And then,

05:14.010 --> 05:17.250
I will have you all to myself to teach.

05:18.140 --> 05:19.630
Uh, thank you!

05:23.400 --> 05:26.970
<i>Oh, right. If nobody else is allowed in,</i>

05:27.800 --> 05:30.510
<i>then she and I will be all 
alone in a private room!</i>

05:32.230 --> 05:36.580
<i>What'll I do? I don't even know 
if I'll be able to concentrate!</i>

05:37.180 --> 05:39.540
I can't wait to see you after school!

05:42.830 --> 05:45.780
I've been studying non-stop 
and it's such a downer!

05:46.090 --> 05:48.530
The stress is seriously awful.

05:48.530 --> 05:51.870
And there's still five days 
until tests start? I just can't.

05:51.870 --> 05:55.290
I wish they'd start right now 
to put me out of my misery.

05:55.290 --> 05:56.630
I know, right?

05:57.440 --> 05:59.370
Oh, isn't that your pal Tsubasa-kun?

05:59.370 --> 06:00.590
Say what?

06:00.590 --> 06:04.640
Yes! I'll go take my stress out on Tsuba-cha!

06:05.020 --> 06:07.640
I feel kinda bad for Tsubasa-kun.

06:07.970 --> 06:09.590
Tsu-ba-

06:09.590 --> 06:10.350
cha?

06:14.710 --> 06:16.090
Rena-senpai?

06:16.090 --> 06:17.610
Well then, Shiki-kun.

06:17.610 --> 06:19.890
After school, where we promised, okay?

06:19.890 --> 06:20.480
Yes.

06:21.320 --> 06:22.380
Thank you very much.

06:26.780 --> 06:27.870
Tsubasa.

06:27.870 --> 06:28.740
Huh?

06:29.870 --> 06:34.030
How... how could... you...

06:34.710 --> 06:37.010
become friends with Rena-senpai?!

06:37.010 --> 06:39.130
I'm so jelly right now!

06:39.130 --> 06:42.210
I even got a Rena-senpai 
sighting in the morning!

06:42.210 --> 06:45.170
She was so pretty, 
I couldn't look her in the face!

06:45.170 --> 06:48.190
A goddess of healing! Farewell, stress!

06:49.700 --> 06:54.810
<i>That's right. Fuyuki-san said she 
totally idolizes Rena-senpai.</i>

06:55.500 --> 06:59.220
Actually, it turns out that Natsukawa-senpai 
is my next door neighbor.

06:59.220 --> 07:01.980
Huh? No way! 
I almost can't breathe right now!

07:02.330 --> 07:04.700
So that's why you came to school together!

07:04.700 --> 07:05.360
Yeah.

07:08.110 --> 07:09.750
Huh?

07:10.130 --> 07:11.920
Something wrong, Fuyuki-san?

07:13.510 --> 07:15.630
No, it's nothing.

07:20.330 --> 07:23.630
We only have morning classes 
for the next three days

07:23.970 --> 07:26.630
so be sure to go straight 
home to study after class.

07:27.190 --> 07:30.600
Also, the library is open 
for independent study.

07:30.600 --> 07:35.280
Be sure you don't disturb others 
if you choose to study there.

07:35.280 --> 07:36.140
That's all.

07:36.730 --> 07:40.400
Tsubasa, you can't study 
with me today either, right?

07:44.410 --> 07:45.740
Sorry, Fuyuki-san.

07:46.150 --> 07:50.270
I really have to try to 
do my best on these tests.

07:50.600 --> 07:52.280
I can't study with you.

07:54.670 --> 07:56.790
Okay. That's fine.

07:56.790 --> 07:58.990
Sorry to be so pushy.

08:03.790 --> 08:06.760
<i>I know I have to make it into the top ten,</i>

08:06.760 --> 08:11.160
<i>but I still hate having to turn down 
Fuyuki-san's invitations like this.</i>

08:12.350 --> 08:16.260
<i>If I told her everything now, 
even if I explain that it's my own fault,</i>

08:16.260 --> 08:19.790
<i>Fuyuki-san is so thoughtful, 
she'd probably blame herself for it.</i>

08:20.400 --> 08:22.810
<i>That is the one thing I want to avoid.</i>

08:23.270 --> 08:26.440
<i>I have to reap what I've sown.</i>

08:26.790 --> 08:31.270
<i>As long as I keep quiet and place in the 
top ten, everything will go back to normal.</i>

08:30.920 --> 08:32.200
<b>Library Storage Room</b>

08:34.170 --> 08:35.680
What is the password?

08:35.680 --> 08:37.870
G-Goryokaku.

08:40.950 --> 08:43.460
I've been waiting, Shiki-kun.

08:44.000 --> 08:45.160
Please excuse me.

08:45.160 --> 08:46.460
Come in.

08:46.460 --> 08:49.640
<i>Wow, she really does like history.</i>

08:49.640 --> 08:51.810
<i>I mean, the password is Goryokaku Fort?</i>

08:51.810 --> 08:53.490
Well then, well then, right this way.

08:55.040 --> 08:57.400
What shall we begin with?

09:00.350 --> 09:02.010
<i>Calm down, man!</i>

09:02.010 --> 09:06.070
<i>This isn't the time to get nervous 
about being alone with her!</i>

09:10.030 --> 09:11.990
I'd like to begin with math, please!

09:16.290 --> 09:19.590
Shiki-kun, you did perfectly fine on this!

09:19.590 --> 09:22.780
At this rate, you might even be 
able to aim for top of the class.

09:22.780 --> 09:26.710
No, not yet. I want to improve my chances,

09:26.710 --> 09:29.380
so if you see any room for 
improvement, please tell me.

09:31.120 --> 09:32.500
All right, then.

09:32.900 --> 09:35.780
There were some careless 
mistakes in your calculations.

09:35.780 --> 09:38.810
In order to increase your accuracy, 
let's solve some more problems.

09:38.810 --> 09:39.390
Sure!

09:39.390 --> 09:42.240
By the way, who is your math teacher?

09:42.240 --> 09:43.780
It's Takahashi-sensei.

09:43.780 --> 09:49.170
That teacher tends to use the same 
problems from quizzes for the finals.

09:49.170 --> 09:50.730
It might help to review them.

09:50.730 --> 09:52.540
The quizzes...!

09:52.540 --> 09:54.660
I didn't think of that. I'll review them.

10:01.740 --> 10:03.670
<i>School is closing for the day.</i>

10:03.670 --> 10:06.890
<i>If there are any remaining students 
on campus, please go home now.</i>

10:06.890 --> 10:11.670
<i>For library committee members, please be 
sure to lock the library when you leave.</i>

10:14.080 --> 10:16.200
Thank you very much for today.

10:16.200 --> 10:17.640
Not at all!

10:17.640 --> 10:21.480
Today inspired me to make more 
progress in my own studies, as well.

10:21.810 --> 10:26.330
But can I really ask you 
for two more days of help?

10:26.330 --> 10:28.690
Yes! I don't mind at all.

10:28.690 --> 10:30.100
Really?

10:30.100 --> 10:32.590
Although, I would like to ask one question.

10:33.200 --> 10:35.610
Why are you studying so hard?

10:38.730 --> 10:40.550
If I don't put in the effort now,

10:40.960 --> 10:44.910
there are some people very dear to me 
who I may never be able to see again.

10:47.290 --> 10:49.960
Actually, I think I would appreciate 
a reward for helping you.

10:51.410 --> 10:54.570
If you are able to reach the rank 
you're hoping for, Shiki-kun,

10:55.460 --> 10:57.630
please go on a date with me.

11:08.520 --> 11:10.650
<i>Does anyone like you anyway?</i>

11:10.650 --> 11:14.900
<i>What have you got going for you? 
In that boring, normal life?</i>

11:14.900 --> 11:16.310
<i>I feel so bad for you.</i>

11:17.750 --> 11:19.120
Hilarious!

11:19.120 --> 11:20.410
Hey, Big Mii?

11:20.620 --> 11:22.400
Don't you have tests soon?

11:22.400 --> 11:24.660
Shouldn't you be studying?

11:25.070 --> 11:28.740
I can't help it! I'm just not in the mood.

11:29.420 --> 11:33.170
Oh, really? But didn't you have a study 
party with Tsuba-cha the other day?

11:34.170 --> 11:36.410
That was different!

11:36.410 --> 11:37.280
Huh?

11:37.990 --> 11:42.990
Well, if you just force yourself to study, 
it won't stick in your head anyway.

11:44.030 --> 11:45.430
Want some Guarana?

11:45.430 --> 11:46.570
Yes!

11:46.570 --> 11:49.520
Mom, you're always so soft on Big Mii.

11:57.110 --> 12:00.020
Refreshing! So good!

12:00.020 --> 12:01.520
Glad to hear it.

12:02.870 --> 12:05.450
Oh, right. Mom, do you...

12:05.780 --> 12:08.830
ever get a heavy feeling in your chest 
that makes it hard to breathe

12:08.830 --> 12:10.970
but it's not a cold?

12:10.970 --> 12:12.170
Huh?

12:12.170 --> 12:15.100
Did you try something weird 
or something? Oh, wow...

12:15.100 --> 12:17.850
That's not what I mean! Geez, never mind!

12:18.680 --> 12:22.380
<i>Name four evergreen trees 
that grow in hilly zones.</i>

12:22.380 --> 12:25.930
Camellia, live oak, chinkapin, camphor.

12:25.930 --> 12:27.930
Natsukawa-senpai
In Call

12:26.440 --> 12:27.930
<i>That is correct.</i>

12:28.350 --> 12:32.180
<i>You had trouble memorizing elevational 
zones, but now you've perfected them!</i>

12:32.180 --> 12:33.770
Thank you very much.

12:33.770 --> 12:36.430
<i>I have nothing but gratitude for your help.</i>

12:33.770 --> 12:36.780
<b>Natsukawa</b>

12:36.780 --> 12:38.930
<i>You tutored me at school</i>

12:38.930 --> 12:41.930
<i>and then you even helped 
me study over the weekend.</i>

12:42.260 --> 12:45.910
<i>Well, it was quite stimulating 
for me, too. And of course...</i>

12:47.030 --> 12:49.790
<i>I still have a reward to look forward to.</i>

12:49.790 --> 12:51.540
Shiki-kun
In Call

12:51.540 --> 12:56.270
<i>Anyway, in anticipation of tomorrow's 
test, I'm going to bed now.</i>

12:56.270 --> 12:59.310
<i>Maintaining your health is another 
important part of test preparation.</i>

12:59.310 --> 13:03.350
A-All right. Good night, Senpai.

13:03.350 --> 13:07.310
You should take care and go to 
bed, too, Shiki-kun. Good night.

13:08.510 --> 13:11.370
Okay. Just a little more.

13:12.450 --> 13:13.310
Yes?

13:14.290 --> 13:16.510
I brought you a late-night snack.

13:16.510 --> 13:17.690
Thank you.

13:19.690 --> 13:22.360
Your tests begin tomorrow, don't they?

13:22.360 --> 13:24.950
Do you feel that you are prepared for them?

13:26.210 --> 13:30.210
I'll do the best I can.
I do want to continue living here.

13:30.950 --> 13:31.770
I see.

13:38.930 --> 13:41.170
Hey, what was this anyway?

13:39.300 --> 13:45.430
Day 1

13:39.300 --> 13:45.430
World
History

13:39.300 --> 13:45.430
Math

13:39.300 --> 13:45.430
Bio

13:41.170 --> 13:43.410
Were you just guessing? Come on, tell us.

13:43.410 --> 13:45.430
Huh? No way.

13:45.430 --> 13:47.570
It's test day!

13:47.570 --> 13:49.950
Now I don't have to study anymore!

13:49.950 --> 13:53.060
You're the only one here who's 
in a positive mood about it.

13:53.060 --> 13:58.770
<b>Revised
World History</b>

13:54.510 --> 13:56.020
Am I gonna be okay?

13:56.020 --> 13:58.960
I ended up playing too many games.

13:58.960 --> 14:01.150
I want to at least get above average.

14:06.980 --> 14:09.030
Huh? What's wrong, Rena-chi?

14:09.030 --> 14:11.180
You usually seem so confident.

14:11.180 --> 14:15.090
They gave it their all. 
I'm sure they'll be fine.

14:15.090 --> 14:17.790
Huh? Who are you talking about? You're so funny.

14:29.310 --> 14:33.810
Test Day

14:33.330 --> 14:33.810
Begin!

14:44.300 --> 14:47.480
Ugh, that was a disaster.

14:47.790 --> 14:50.870
I guess I could spend a 
day studying in the library.

14:57.060 --> 14:58.290
Tsubasa!

14:58.290 --> 15:01.290
<b>Library Storage Room</b>

15:01.550 --> 15:02.800
Huh?

15:18.310 --> 15:21.270
English

15:18.310 --> 15:21.270
Japanese

15:18.310 --> 15:21.290
Test Day 2

15:31.730 --> 15:33.630
I guess it's finally over after today, huh?

15:33.630 --> 15:35.410
Oh. You're right.

15:35.620 --> 15:38.540
Hey, were you studying 
in the library yesterday?

15:38.750 --> 15:39.230
Huh?

15:39.230 --> 15:42.420
Well, I thought I'd go study in the library,

15:42.720 --> 15:47.070
and I saw you in the hallway and tried 
to catch up, but then I lost you.

15:48.540 --> 15:50.430
Maybe it was someone else?

15:50.690 --> 15:53.430
Uh, yeah, I guess.

15:53.660 --> 15:57.540
Okay, okay. I must've been exhausted.

15:59.430 --> 16:02.930
<i>I didn't mean to keep this thing 
with Natsukawa-senpai a secret...</i>

16:03.530 --> 16:06.870
When the tests are over, 
let's hang out! And let loose!

16:07.930 --> 16:09.250
Yeah. Let's do it!

16:09.250 --> 16:12.170
All right! I'm super excited!

16:12.170 --> 16:13.140
<i>Right.</i>

16:13.140 --> 16:17.090
<i>If I can get into the top ten, 
then all of this will be over.</i>

16:17.460 --> 16:19.310
<i>Including keeping secrets from Fuyuki-san.</i>

16:19.850 --> 16:21.580
<i>I've got to pull this off!</i>

16:25.900 --> 16:27.840
<b>One Week Later</b>

16:30.190 --> 16:31.340
So wack...

16:31.600 --> 16:34.790
You were a lot cheerier 
at the start of the tests.

16:34.790 --> 16:37.790
But the more grades you get back, 
the more depressed you look.

16:37.790 --> 16:41.480
Yeah, 'cause this was a total disaster!

16:41.960 --> 16:47.740
The only questions I felt good about were 
the ones from when we studied with Tsubasa.

16:48.260 --> 16:49.630
Sounds like a fatal blow.

16:50.390 --> 16:52.930
So how did you place, Sayurin?

16:52.930 --> 16:54.660
I did so-so, I guess.

16:54.660 --> 16:59.410
Year 1 Class 4 Akino Sayuri
 Five Subjects Combined Score 386 Points
 Overall Rank 72 out of 176

16:55.050 --> 16:57.280
A little bit above average.

16:57.280 --> 16:59.050
I'm always like this, though.

16:59.410 --> 17:08.420
Year 1 Class 4 Fuyuki Minami
 Five Subjects Combined Score 237 Points
 Overall Rank 148 out of 176

17:00.300 --> 17:05.240
I should've listened to 
Tsubasa and studied harder.

17:05.240 --> 17:08.420
My score is so much worse 
than last time, I'm in shock!

17:08.770 --> 17:12.610
Ugh. I wonder how Tsubasa did.

17:11.300 --> 17:13.550
<b>Library Storage Room</b>

17:17.240 --> 17:20.810
<b>History of
Japanese Clothing</b>

17:18.510 --> 17:20.810
How did it go, Shiki-kun?

17:22.900 --> 17:23.910
Actually, I...

17:25.450 --> 17:26.870
got third place!

17:26.870 --> 17:29.940
Year 1 Class 4 Shiki Tsubasa
 Five Subjects Combined Score   480 Points
 Overall Rank 3 out of 176

17:26.870 --> 17:29.940
I got into the top ten, 
just like I wanted to!

17:29.940 --> 17:34.360
The stuff from the math 
quizzes and elevational zones

17:34.360 --> 17:36.470
was all the exact same way on the finals!

17:36.950 --> 17:38.950
It's all thanks to your help!

17:39.860 --> 17:41.580
I'm glad to hear that!

17:41.890 --> 17:44.180
How did you do, Senpai?

17:44.950 --> 17:50.170
I made you spend so much time helping me, 
if that made you lose some places...

17:50.170 --> 17:52.300
You have no need to worry.

17:52.300 --> 17:55.790
Year 2 Class 1 Natsukawa Rena
 Five Subjects Combined Score 497 Points
 Overall Rank 1 out of 172

17:52.870 --> 17:55.790
I got first place, like always.

17:56.130 --> 17:57.670
That's insane!

17:57.670 --> 18:00.630
Do you still remember 
your promise, Shiki-kun?

18:02.070 --> 18:02.870
Yes...

18:04.650 --> 18:07.550
I am looking forward to Saturday.

18:09.860 --> 18:13.320
Mii, I'm going shopping. 
There anything you want?

18:16.650 --> 18:18.900
What? Are you still in bed?

18:18.900 --> 18:20.440
Mm-hmm.

18:22.250 --> 18:26.250
M'kay, I'll be back later. 
Message me if you think of something.

18:26.250 --> 18:27.600
Yah.

18:28.360 --> 18:30.840
Tsubasa-chan, where are you going in that?

18:31.130 --> 18:33.020
Ah, well...

18:33.020 --> 18:35.090
just out for tea with a friend.

18:35.340 --> 18:41.010
Well, you did score in the top ten, so I 
suppose I shouldn't be too inquisitive.

18:41.010 --> 18:43.350
Thank you, Grandma. See you later.

18:48.750 --> 18:51.260
<i>I left a little earlier than I wanted.</i>

18:51.260 --> 18:54.390
<i>I've still got 15 minutes 
before we're supposed to meet.</i>

18:54.700 --> 18:56.000
Shiki-kun!

18:58.580 --> 18:59.370
Whoa!

19:04.370 --> 19:06.020
I've been waiting!

19:12.590 --> 19:14.970
<i>What overwhelming loveliness!</i>

19:14.970 --> 19:18.050
<i>She look so perfect in that, 
I can hardly look at her!</i>

19:18.300 --> 19:21.480
You really do look handsome in 
Japanese clothes, Shiki-kun!

19:22.070 --> 19:26.310
I promise not to suddenly grab 
on to you today, so don't worry.

19:26.570 --> 19:27.970
O-Okay.

19:27.970 --> 19:31.340
I truly have been looking forward to today!

19:32.090 --> 19:35.620
I've dreamt of going on a date in Japanese dress since I was a child!

19:35.620 --> 19:40.070
I was so excited that I simply couldn't wait 
and left home much earlier than planned!

19:42.930 --> 19:43.930
<i>This is bad!</i>

19:43.930 --> 19:47.080
<i>She's like pure sunlight. I feel like I'll 
be sanitized by the end of the day!</i>

19:47.910 --> 19:51.090
If you are so willing, please allow 
me the honor of escorting you today.

19:51.480 --> 19:54.340
What a wonderful response. 
Spoken like a true samurai!

19:54.720 --> 19:57.030
Well then, shall we go?

20:01.870 --> 20:04.490
All right, what's the attack plan for today?

20:04.490 --> 20:07.760
Maybe hit Sapporo Drug 
first to get some makeup...

20:08.670 --> 20:10.650
Huh? Oh, isn't that Tsuba-chi?

20:10.990 --> 20:14.800
Why's he in Japanese-style clothes? 
And that person he's with...

20:15.150 --> 20:16.140
Oh, dear!

20:31.090 --> 20:33.490
Do I have something on my face?

20:33.490 --> 20:38.550
Uh, no! I'm just impressed by 
how well you wear a kimono.

20:39.540 --> 20:42.680
Thank you very much. I have several of them,

20:43.090 --> 20:46.430
but today I decided to wear 
my number one favorite.

20:48.000 --> 20:51.480
S-So, we never really 
decided where to go today.

20:51.480 --> 20:54.690
Oh, that's true. Where shall we go?

20:54.930 --> 20:59.420
<i>This is the sort of thing that the guy 
is supposed to think of ahead of time.</i>

20:59.950 --> 21:00.700
<i>But...</i>

21:01.090 --> 21:06.200
I don't go out very often, so I 
didn't have any good spots in mind.

21:06.560 --> 21:07.950
I'm sorry.

21:11.970 --> 21:13.580
No need to worry.

21:19.330 --> 21:23.960
As long as I'm out here with you, 
Shiki-kun, I'm happy going anywhere.

21:27.830 --> 21:30.610
Even just walking down the street like this.

21:41.230 --> 21:43.090
A-Are you sure?

21:43.090 --> 21:43.870
Yes.

21:44.120 --> 21:48.090
Th-Then, shall we just walk for a while?

21:48.090 --> 21:48.930
Yes!

